        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek E6000, LISCIO Electronic Keypad Leverset with Bluetooth</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe LISCIO Electronic Keypad Leverset with Bluetooth is a ready-to-use keypad door lever that is suitable for interior and exterior use. It will fit a standard pre-drilled door. Now here's the exciting stuff: the tech side of this electronic door lock. The Bluetooth Modern Electronic Keypad Leverset is app enabled and can be locked and unlocked using your smart phone. The Emtek App allows you to access users logs as well as create new users codes, so you know who's had access to you house and when. It also has a manual key access.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis LISCIO Electronic Keypad Leverset ships standard with the Helios Lever for the interior to match the exterior. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if you require a different lever style for the interior trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the LISCIO Electronic Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Unlock with the app.</li>\r\n<li>App allows you to Manage Users and see a Log Record of who’s entered and when.</li>\r\n<li>Will replace most existing handle types. Requires standard 2-1/8” dia. tubular door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Ready to use straight out of the box: Comes programmed with 2 unique, secure user codes.</li>\r\n<li>Can store up to 20 user codes.</li>\r\n<li>Weatherproofed for exterior doors.</li>\r\n<li>Low battery warning.</li>\r\n<li>No wiring means it is easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lock may also be unlocked and locked via keyed cylinder, each lock comes with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 2 Year Electronics Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek E6000 Liscio Electronic Keypad Leverset\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Rose Height: 4.680\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Rose Width: 2.910\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Height: 6.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Width: 2.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1 3/4” to 2 1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 9-Volt (included)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-E6000-specifications.pdf?v=1704262415\"><b>Emtek E6000 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/keypad-locks\">Keypad Locks</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Electronic Keypad Leverset",
                "description": "The LISCIO Electronic Keypad Leverset with Bluetooth is a ready-to-use keypad door lever that is suitable for interior and exterior use. It will fit a standard pre-drilled door. Now here's the exciting stuff: the tech side of this electronic door lock. The Bluetooth Modern Electronic Keypad Leverset is app enabled and can be locked and unlocked using your smart phone. The Emtek App allows you to access users logs as well as create new users codes, so you know who's had access to you house and when. It also has a manual key access. Choose your favorite style Emtek door lever!",
                "keywords": "LISCIO Electronic Keypad Leversets, Modern Electronic Keypad Leversets, Emtek Modern Electronic Keypad Leverset, Emtek E6000, Emtek E6000 Liscio Electronic Keypad Leverset, smart door locks, wifi lock, wifi deadbolts, bluetooth deadbolts,  keypad deadbolts, auto-lock keypad entry levers, code door locks"
